## Interface: 120000
## Notes: Threat management for tanks. Color-coded party/raid bars with one-click taunting, class & role icons (Tank/Healer/DPS), dual spell-cooldown indicators, interrupt slot, target/focus taunt buttons, raid-marker bar, tabbed options, frame scale/opacity, bar sort, compact mode, solo target bar, hide-when-solo, raid DPS filter, per-character spells, pull alerts, and Show Self. Updated for Midnight Pre-Patch 12.0.0.
